Key 2025 details:
- **Transport**: Next.js route streams `ReadableStream` with `Content-Type: text/event-stream` or AI SDK `UIMessage` stream. Flush headers early (`await writer.ready`).
- **Deltas**: text deltas arrive per token; tool-call deltas arrive as JSON fragments — buffer until `tool_call_complete` before executing.
- **Abort**: pass `AbortSignal` to `streamText`; client `useChat stop()` or `controller.abort()` on unmount / nav / new prompt. Server cancels LLM stream to stop billing.
- **Backpressure**: if client slow, `writer.write` queues — observe `desiredSize`. Resume via persisted `messageId` + `lastSequence`.

| Concern | Solution | Anti-pattern |
|---|---|---|
| Flicker / layout shift | throttle `requestAnimationFrame`, stream markdown as AST | setState per token unsafely |
| Tool calls | buffer deltas, execute after complete, append result | exec on partial JSON |
| Cost on abort | `signal` -> abort provider stream | leave stream dangling |
| Disconnect | `EventSource` retry + server `lastEventId` | lose response, user retries = double bill |

